### Gemini AI Chatbot API Testing

# Biến môi trường
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Test Chat Message - Valid Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Làm thế nào để đăng ký hộ khẩu mới?",
  "conversationId": "test-conversation-1"
}

### 2. Test Chat Message - Without Conversation ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Hướng dẫn tôi cách đăng ký tạm trú"
}

### 3. Test Chat Message - Administrative Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Các bước để tách hộ khẩu là gì?"
}

### 4. Test Chat Message - System Usage Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Làm sao để xem thông tin cá nhân của tôi trong hệ thống?"
}

### 5. Test Chat Message - Empty Message (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": ""
}

### 6. Test Chat Message - Very Long Message (Should Fail if > 5000 chars)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (text longer than 5000 characters)"
}

### 7. Test Chat Message - Without Authentication (Should Fail with 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Test without auth"
}
